<title>USA: WPL Holdings unit sells $105 mln debentures.</title>
<headline>WPL Holdings unit sells $105 mln debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Wisconsin Power &amp; Light Co, a unit of WPL Holdings Inc was priced Wednesday said lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc, according to a source close to the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER WISCONSIN POWER &amp; LIGHT CO</p>
<p>AMT $105 MLN	 COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.715  FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3   YIELD 7.041 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS  SPREAD 59 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
